		<div class="split split-b">
			<section id="leisure">
				<div class="puz-head"><h3>Interests</h3><span>Off the clock</span></div>
				<div class="leisure">
					<figure><img src={`${A}/gym.webp`} width="760" height="760" loading="lazy" alt="Halftone illustration of a gym, Mehmet Utku Öztürk in the mirror" /><figcaption>A competitive Class II powerlifter, in the mirror.</figcaption></figure>
					<ul class="pastimes">
						<li><strong>Powerlifting &amp; strongman.</strong> Competitive, Class II. <button class="act" id="lift" type="button">load the bar</button><output id="liftOut"></output></li>
						<li><strong>Martial arts.</strong> Brazilian jiu-jitsu &amp; kickboxing.</li>
						<li><strong>Chess.</strong> <button class="act" id="chess" type="button">move the knight</button><output id="chessOut"></output></li>
						<li><strong>Sudoku.</strong> There is one <a href="#puzzles">below</a>.</li>
